		line=1107,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"With a bag of manjuu in hand, I come to pay my respects at the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Informing the reception priestess of my destination, I venture into the temple's inner sanctum.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Kotone has been awfully busy lately, carrying out her duties until well into the night.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"And so, I decided to pay her a visit on my way home from training.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"I carefully make my way to the Imperial Temple's innermost hall of worship.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"At this late hour, not a single other soul is to be found.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I spot her solemn, solitary figure kneeling in front of the altar and call out to her, but immediately think better of it.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Facing a gilt bronze mirror─the representation of\nOomikami─Kotone's eyes are closed in concentrated prayer.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Her tiny back radiates an overpowering majesty, as though Oomikami Himself had descended upon this hallowed hall.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The tranquil atmosphere freezes me in place, and I scarcely dare to even breathe.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I simply stand and stare in silent awe.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Phew...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Eventually, Kotone stands up after letting out a light exhale.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"With that as my signal, I approach her from behind.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“H-Huh? Soujin-sama, what might you be doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Kotone quirks her head in puzzlement.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Somehow, the solemn atmosphere pervading the hall moments ago is no longer anywhere to be found.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah! Could it be that I forgot we arranged to have a date tonight?!”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, don't worry.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I just happened to be in the neighborhood, so I came to pay you a visit.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, that is reassuring to hear.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Kotone strokes her brow in relief.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Done with your duties for the day?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Not yet. I still need to read and reply to a correspondence concerning the upcoming festival.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your work is never done, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahaha, I do not consider it burdensome at all.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Though now that you mention it...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Kotone bashfully trails off, clutching at her stomach.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As ashamed as I am to admit it, I may be feeling rather peckish at the moment...”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But I suppose that is simply my burden to bear.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds like I came at just the right time, then.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"As soon as I show her the bag in my hands, Kotone's eyes light up with delight.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh, could it be─?!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Manjuu, fresh from Samuraya.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I knew I married you for a reason, Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, a loving spouse truly is a girl's best friend!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Kotone merrily tears open the paper bag stuffed full of manjuu.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"But before she digs in, she takes one out and holds it in front of my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Here you are, Soujin-sama. Say 'ah,' if you please.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Aren't you hungry?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I still wish to feed you first.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Pretty please? Nobody is even here to see us.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"The last time we did this in the school cafeteria, we sure got a real earful.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"But now, I unhesitatingly take a big bite of the manjuu\nshe's proffering me.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"The subtle sweetness of the red bean paste filling spreads across my tongue.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, now it is my turn!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You got it.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"I take another manjuu and hold it out invitingly in front of\nKotone's mouth.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haahm!”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nmmhmhm...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Kotone lets out a blissful mumble as she munches on the manjuu.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"We gaze at each other in silence as we continue chewing.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Whenever I smile back at her, she nearly spits hers out.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“*Gulp, gulp...* Phew! I feel as good as new!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And let me add that having you feed me made it taste twice as good as usual.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Would you care for another one?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nah, I'll pass.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Then don't mind if I─haahm!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Kotone proceeds to stuff her cheeks once more.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Lost in the sweet bliss of the manjuu, she claps her hands to her cheeks in delight.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"I'll never get tired of watching all the bountiful expressions\nshe's capable of.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nmmhmhm... At this rate, I will get fat in no time.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And yet, I simply cannot resist indulging myself. What a sinful woman I am... Om nom nom...”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Her cheeks still stuffed full to the brim, Kotone nonetheless reaches for another manjuu.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone, are you planning on eating the whole bag in one sitting?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Gah!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“O-Of course not.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"She stiffly replies, refusing to meet my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"She was definitely intending to eat the whole bag in one sitting.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Hungry or not, that's still way too much for a late-night snack.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"As a warrior trained from birth to eat simply and frugally, I\ncan't let this slide.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll let you have the rest tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aah, you heartless monster!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"As I snatch the bag of manjuu away from her, Kotone immediately dives after it.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Even when I hold it above my head, Kotone leaps up and down on her tiptoes to try and grab it back.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"It'd be a real scandal if the people ever saw the Exalt-Priestess acting like this.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall abstain! I promise to not eat any more today, so please do not take them away!”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I beg you! You have my word!”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Swear to Oomikami?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Umm...”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Her eyes immediately start wandering again.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yep, I'm definitely taking these with me.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You're evil, Soujin-sama! How could you invoke\nOomikami's name at a time like this?!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh... Please, at least let me have just one more...”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Groveling is unseemly, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A warrior's wife should learn to concede with dignity.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Well, a priestess's man should learn to have some compassion for the misfortunate!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"This argument is going nowhere.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"But as soon as Kotone starts puffing out her cheeks, I'm left with no choice but to cave in.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"That expression of hers is just impossible to say no to.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Just the one, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Kotone's face immediately lights up once again.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hold on a sec, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Kotone immediately snaps to attention at my words.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"I can't help but imagine her as an obedient puppy.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Though the way she's so true to her desires makes me want to tease her just a little.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Sit, girl.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? You want me to sit down?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Kotone obediently takes a seat.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"She proceeds to peer at me with a slightly confused expression.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Um... might I ask why you had me sit down?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You reminded me of a dog.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“A dog, you say? I have never heard that one before...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Kotone replies incredulously.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"But, apparently having come up with a great idea, she grins excitedly to herself.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Woof, woof!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee, how was that?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Kotone blushes slightly, her embarrassment seeming to have finally caught up with her.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama? Whyever are you covering your mouth?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah! You are laughing at me, aren't you? How rude!”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah, you're right. Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"I'd sooner hang up my blade than admit that I was actually smiling at how outrageously adorable she was.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"I force my mouth back into a neutral expression and reach over to hand her a manjuu.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aah...”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Kotone rises up on her hind legs slightly, her mouth wide open.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"...She really is just like a dog.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I'm unable to resist giving her a few pats on the head before I feed her the manjuu.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Awawa, that tickles, Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Gosh, just give me the manjuu already...”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ehehee, but this is not so bad either...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Kotone leans into my hand, narrowing her eyes contentedly.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I can practically see her tail wagging behind her.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Here's your manjuu.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ohh, thank you very much!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Kotone instantly sinks her teeth into the manjuu as soon as I hold it out before her.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"She happily chews on it as I continue to stroke her head.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“*Gulp...* Ahh, how sublime!”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haah, but I suppose that is all for today...”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"She murmurs dejectedly as she peers up at me with her best puppy dog eyes.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Um, Soujin-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh, I did not even say anything yet.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Kotone slumps her shoulders in despair.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Seeing her act like that, a wicked desire bubbles up within my chest.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Kotone. I hate to ask, but could you show me your dog impression one more time?”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? Again?!”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It was already terribly embarrassing the first time around...”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Kotone sulkily pouts her lips.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But if you truly insist... I would perhaps consider it if another manjuu were on the table.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure, it's a deal.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"And not a bad one, if I say so myself.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Very well. Here I go...”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
